WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.490
- You typically bring people together,

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:03.900
but you and your wife, Abby,

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.400
set off a fierce online
debate regarding dishwashers.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.630
- Yes, she is so controlling
about the dishwasher, Kelly.

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:13.490
Sometimes, I load it

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:17.050
and she will reload it
when I leave the room.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.400
So it's more organized.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.800
I don't know what people's
problem is about doing that.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:22.670
I'm not sure.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:26.180
- Well, just to let you know,

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:28.310
I have found her
doppelganger and that is me.

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:30.693
I am Abby. (laughs)

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:33.463
I am the one.

00:00:33.463 --> 00:00:36.150
I'm like, just stop. (laughs)

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.480
Like, I'll do it.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.540
But we have the video
that kicked this off.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.760
It's awesome.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.302
- [Abby] This is a kerfuffle.

00:00:42.302 --> 00:00:45.423
- [Glennon] What are you talking about?

00:00:45.423 --> 00:00:49.570
- [Abby] Glennon, this is not
how you pack a dishwasher.

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:51.814
- [Glennon] It's gonna
wash the same exact dish.

00:00:51.814 --> 00:00:52.647
- [Abby] No, no, no, no, no.

00:00:52.647 --> 00:00:54.003
Here's the problem.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:59.130
When I redo this, it
wouldn't even need to wash.

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.210
We could wait a whole day.

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:01.043
- You know what?

00:01:01.043 --> 00:01:02.510
You, oh, you're gonna redo this.

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:06.300
You are unbelievably dish controlling.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.180
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:08.917
- I don't know, Glennon.

00:01:08.917 --> 00:01:10.570
(audience claps)

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.318
I saw that and I was like,
- Kelly,

00:01:12.318 --> 00:01:14.373
it's an untamed dishwasher.

00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:16.800
That is an untamed dishwasher.
- I-

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.770
Well, something should be
tamed is what I'm saying

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:21.850
because I saw that and
I was like, oh my God.

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:23.640
And if there's food on it, I can't.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.080
Like, I don't think you
need to, like, wash it.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.730
But like, there's not tiny
people in the dishwasher,

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.800
like, scrubbing it for you, you know?

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:30.640
So you gotta do a lot.

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:33.350
I am 100% Abby on this one,

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:35.570
so you have lost me in this.

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:37.150
But I want to say,

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:37.983
it's nice, though,

00:01:37.983 --> 00:01:40.080
to have a partner, like, in life

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.430
that will do the dishes with you.

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:42.320
I'll say that.

